{"title":"Inside Candace Owens plans to dominate women's media","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/candace-owens-new-media-company-club-candace-daily-wire-independent","date":1738170086000,"content":"<div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F481b955f-fdf6-4a67-92ba-8d0ce57b2e72_2574x1588.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F481b955f-fdf6-4a67-92ba-8d0ce57b2e72_2574x1588.png\" width=\"2574\" height=\"1588\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F481b955f-fdf6-4a67-92ba-8d0ce57b2e72_2574x1588.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F481b955f-fdf6-4a67-92ba-8d0ce57b2e72_2574x1588.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F481b955f-fdf6-4a67-92ba-8d0ce57b2e72_2574x1588.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F481b955f-fdf6-4a67-92ba-8d0ce57b2e72_2574x1588.png 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Decades ago, women's media was dominated by print magazines that doled out fitness tips, marriage advice, and housekeeping guidance. Heteronormativity ruled, and a woman's place was at home, raising a family.</p><p>These media outlets shaped the cultural landscape for women for decades, but by the turn of the millennium, the internet was making them obsolete. …</p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/candace-owens-new-media-company-club-candace-daily-wire-independent\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"3f6e30e61aea39970824ef44656a21735cf47653aa8db6cc382df6f97bf3b76a","category":"Sites"}